 “Efektivitas Terapi Fisik dalam Pengelolaan Nyeri Punggung Bawah Kronis.” Jurnal Ortopedi dan Trauma, vol. 15, no. 2, 2023, hlm. 123-134."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dr. Arya, M.D., dkk. “Hasil Pengobatan Bedah pada Fraktur Kompleks Tulang Paha.” Jurnal Bedah Ortopedi, vol. 22, no. 4, 2022, hlm. 567-578."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dr. Arya, M.D., dkk. “Faktor Genetik dalam Pengembangan Osteoartritis.” Jurnal Kedokteran Genetika, vol. 18, no. 1, 2021, hlm. 98-109."}]}]}]}]}}','2025-10-15 02:08:09','2025-10-15 02:13:37');
INSERT INTO doctors VALUES(10,'dr. Riko Radityatama Susilo, M.Ked(ORL-HNS), Sp.T.H.T.B.K.L.','dr-riko-radityatama-susilo-mkedorl-hns-spthtbkl',6,'9','{"en":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"dr. Riko Radityatama Susilo, M.Ked(ORL-HNS), Sp.T.H.T.B.K.L., is a dedicated Ear, Nose, Throat, Head and Neck Surgery (ENT-HNS) specialist committed to providing the best possible care for his patients. He currently practices at Altius Hospitals Bekasi and actively treats various health complaints related to the ears, nose, throat, and disorders in the head and neck area."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(82, 82, 82); margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"Overused Grotesk\", sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"As a doctor who prioritizes thorough diagnosis and appropriate treatment, dr. Riko always listens to each patient''s complaints with full attention. With a friendly and professional approach, he believes that collaboration between doctors and patients is the key to successful treatment."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(82, 82, 82); margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"Overused Grotesk\", sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"dr. Riko Radityatama Susilo, M.Ked(ORL-HNS), Sp.T.H.T.B.K.L., completed his Specialist Education in T.H.T.B.K.L at the University of North Sumatra in 2021."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"dr. Riko is also an active member of the Indonesian Medical Association (IDI) and the Indonesian Association of Ear, Nose, and Throat, Head, and Neck Specialists (PERHATI-KL)."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"In addition to his clinical practice, dr. Riko is also active in various medical seminars and training programs to update his knowledge and apply the latest technologies and methods in the field of ENT."}]}]},"id":"<p>dr. Riko Radityatama Susilo, M.Ked(ORL-HNS), Sp.T.H.T.B.K.L., adalah seorang spesialis Bedah Telinga, Hidung, Tenggorokan, Kepala, dan Leher (ENT-HNS) yang berkomitmen untuk memberikan perawatan terbaik bagi pasiennya. Saat ini, ia praktik di Rumah Sakit Altius Bekasi dan secara aktif menangani berbagai keluhan kesehatan terkait telinga, hidung, tenggorokan, serta gangguan di area kepala dan leher.</p><p>Sebagai dokter yang mengutamakan diagnosis yang teliti dan pengobatan yang tepat, dr. Riko selalu mendengarkan keluhan setiap pasien dengan penuh perhatian. Dengan pendekatan yang ramah dan profesional, ia percaya bahwa kolaborasi antara dokter dan pasien adalah kunci keberhasilan pengobatan.</p><p></p><p>dr. Riko Radityatama Susilo, M.Ked(ORL-HNS), Sp.T.H.T.B.K.L., menyelesaikan pendidikan spesialis T.H.T.B.K.L. di Universitas Sumatera Utara pada tahun 2021.</p><p>dr. Riko juga merupakan anggota aktif dari Ikatan Dokter Indonesia (IDI) dan Perhimpunan Ahli Telinga, Hidung, Tenggorokan, Kepala, dan Leher Indonesia (PERHATI-KL).</p><p>Selain praktik klinisnya, dr. Riko juga aktif mengikuti berbagai seminar medis dan program pelatihan untuk memperbarui pengetahuannya dan menerapkan teknologi dan metode terbaru di bidang THT.</p>"}','{"en":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","class":null,"style":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"With extensive experience in his field, Dr. Riko has expertise in:","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"style":"color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"Overused Grotesk\", sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;","class":null}}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","class":null,"style":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Diagnosis & treatment of ear, nose, throat, head, and neck diseases","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"style":"color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"Overused Grotesk\", sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;","class":null}}]}]}],"attrs":{"class":null,"style":null}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","class":null,"style":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hearing tests","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"style":"color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"Overused Grotesk\", sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;","class":null}}]}]}],"attrs":{"class":null,"style":null}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","class":null,"style":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Treatment of infections & allergies of the nose, sinusitis, and respiratory disorders","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"style":"color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"Overused Grotesk\", sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;","class":null}}]}]}],"attrs":{"class":null,"style":null}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","class":null,"style":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ENT-KL surgery for various medical conditions","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"style":"color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: \"