s: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Terms & Conditions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"– Package prices do not include administrative fees."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"– If there are additional examinations outside of the package, they will be charged according to the rates already in place at the hospital."}]}]},"id":"<p>Urine yang Tidak Biasa? Saatnya Periksa!</p><p>Nikmati paket skrining urologi terlengkap yang ditawarkan oleh Altius Hospitals!</p><p>1. Skrining Ginjal Dasar</p><p>Harga: IDR 500.000 dengan komponen pemeriksaan berikut:</p><p>a. Konsultasi dan pemeriksaan fisik dengan Spesialis Urologi</p><p>b. Ultrasonografi Urologi</p><p>2. Skrining Ginjal Lanjutan</p><p>Harga: IDR 1.000.000 dengan komponen pemeriksaan berikut:</p><p>a. Konsultasi dan pemeriksaan fisik dengan Spesialis Urologi</p><p>b. Ultrasonografi Urologi</p><p>c. CT Scan Urologi Tanpa Kontras</p><p>d. Laboratorium: Urea, Kreatinin, Analisis Urin Lengkap</p><p>3. Skrining Kesehatan Prostat</p><p>Harga: IDR 1.500.000 dengan komponen pemeriksaan berikut:</p><p>a. Konsultasi dan pemeriksaan fisik dengan Spesialis Urologi</p><p>b. Ultrasonografi Urologi</p><p>c. Uroflowmetri</p><p>d. Laboratorium: Urea, Kreatinin, Analisis Urin Lengkap, PSA (Antigen Spesifik Prostat)</p><p>Syarat &amp; Ketentuan</p><p>– Harga paket tidak termasuk biaya administrasi.</p><p>– Jika ada pemeriksaan tambahan di luar paket, akan dikenakan biaya sesuai tarif yang berlaku di rumah sakit.</p>"}',1,'2025-10-17 02:19:42','2025-10-17 02:21:02');
INSERT INTO offers VALUES(12,'{"en":"Vaccination Package for All Ages","id":"Paket Vaksinasi untuk Semua Usia"}','{"en":"vaccination-package-for-all-ages","id":"paket-vaksinasi-untuk-semua-usia"}','18','{"en":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stay Protected with Altius Vaccination Packages"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vaccines are one of the most effective ways to prevent infectious diseases. Altius Hospitals offers vaccination packages tailored for children, adults, and travelers at special promotional rates."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our medical team ensures that every vaccination is carried out safely, comfortably, and according to international health standards."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Available Vaccines"}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Childhood Vaccines","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" – MMR, Polio, Hepatitis B, DPT"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Adult Vaccines","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" – Influenza, Hepatitis A & B, HPV, Tetanus"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Travel Vaccines","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" – Yellow Fever, Typhoid, and more"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Each package includes consultation with a doctor and post-vaccine monitoring for your safety. Protect yourself and your loved ones today."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"start","style":"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Because prevention is always better than cure – invest in your health with Altius Hospitals.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}]},"id":"<h2 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Tetap Terlindungi dengan Paket Vaksinasi Altius</h2><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Vaksinasi merupakan salah satu cara paling efektif untuk mencegah penyakit menular. Rumah Sakit Altius menawarkan paket vaksinasi yang disesuaikan untuk anak-anak, dewasa, dan pelancong dengan tarif promosi khusus.  </p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Tim medis kami memastikan setiap vaksinasi dilakukan dengan aman, nyaman, dan sesuai dengan standar kesehatan internasional.  </p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Vaksin yang Tersedia  </h3><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li><p><strong>Vaksin Anak-Anak </strong>– MMR, Polio, Hepatitis B, DPT</p></li><li><p><strong>Vaksin Dewasa </strong>– Influenza, Hepatitis A &amp; B, HPV, Tetanus</p></li><li><p><strong>Vaksin Perjalanan </strong>– Demam Kuning, Tifus, dan lainnya</p></li></ul><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Setiap paket termasuk konsultasi dengan dokter dan pemantauan pasca-vaksinasi untuk keamanan Anda. Lindungi diri Anda dan orang-orang terkasih Anda hari ini.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong>Karena pencegahan selalu lebih baik daripada pengobatan – investasikan kesehatan Anda dengan Rumah Sakit Altius.</strong></p>"}',1,'2025-10-17 02:22:51','2025-10-17 02:25:26');
INSERT INTO offers VALUES(13,'{"en":"BIRTH PACKAGE at Altius Hospital","id":"PAKET MELAHIRKAN di Altius Hospitals"}','{"en":"birth-package-at-altius-hospital","id":"paket-melahirkan-di-altius-hospitals"}','18','{"en":"<h2 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Get the most comfortable childbirth experience at Altius Hospitals.</h2><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Of course, we offer the best deals for you and your little one!</p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">1. Normal Childbirth Package &gt; 2 days 1 night</h3><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Prices start from:</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong>Class 3</strong>: IDR 10,500,000<br><strong>Class 2</strong>: IDR 12,000,000<br><strong>Class 1</strong>: IDR 13,900,000<br><strong>VIP Class</strong>: IDR 15,000,000<br><strong>VVIP Class</strong>: IDR 17,000,000</p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">2. SC Delivery Package - Eracs &gt; 3 days 2 nights</h3><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Prices start from:</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong>Class 3</strong>: IDR 22,700,000<br><strong>Class 2</strong>: IDR 24,300,000<br><strong>Class 1</strong>: IDR 27,200,000<br><strong>VIP Class</strong>: IDR 35,500,000<br><strong>VVIP Class</strong>: IDR 40,400,000</p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Terms &amp; Conditions, as follows:</h3><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">A. BONUS: Medicine &amp; BHP fees, 1-level room upgrade, baby bathing &amp; breastfeeding class, pregnancy exercise class.<br>B. Each package includes: Baby photo (1 photo &amp; print with 20x30 cm photo frame), baby piercing (for baby girls).<br>C. Pre-operative examinations are included.<br>D. CITO procedures/complications (surgeon fees, anesthesia, and room rental) are not included.<br>E. This promotion is only for patients with private insurance.<br>F. This package is only valid for the first C-section.<br>G. The Childbirth Package rates are valid until the end of December 2025.</p>","id":"<p>Dapatkan pengalaman persalinan yang paling nyaman di Rumah Sakit Altius.</p><p>Tentu saja, kami menawarkan penawaran terbaik untuk Anda dan buah hati Anda!</p><p>1. Paket Persalinan Normal &gt; 2 hari 1 malam</p><p>Harga mulai dari:</p><p>Kelas 3: IDR 10.500.000</p><p>Kelas 2: IDR 12.000.000</p><p>Kelas 1: IDR 13.900.000</p><p>Kelas VIP: IDR 15.000.000</p><p>Kelas VVIP: IDR 17.000.000</p><p>2. Paket Pengiriman SC - Eracs &gt; 3 hari 2 malam</p><p>Harga mulai dari:</p><p>Kelas 3: IDR 22.700.000</p><p>Kelas 2: IDR 24.300.000</p><p>Kelas 1: IDR 27.200.000</p><p>Kelas VIP: IDR 35.500.000</p><p>Kelas VVIP: IDR 40.400.000</p><p>Syarat &amp; Ketentuan, sebagai berikut:</p><p>A. BONUS: Biaya obat-obatan &amp; BHP, upgrade kamar 1 tingkat, kelas mandi bayi &amp; menyusui, kelas olahraga kehamilan.</p><p>B. Setiap paket termasuk: Foto bayi (1 foto &amp; cetakan dengan bingkai foto 20x30 cm), tindik bayi (untuk bayi perempuan).</p><p>C. Pemeriksaan pra-operasi termasuk dalam paket.</p><p>D. Prosedur/komplikasi CITO (biaya bedah, anestesi, dan sewa kamar) tidak termasuk.</p><p>E. Promosi ini hanya berlaku untuk pasien dengan asuransi swasta.</p><p>F. Paket ini hanya berlaku untuk operasi caesar pertama.</p><p>G. Tarif Paket Persalinan berlaku hingga akhir Desember 2025.</p>"}',2,'2025-10-17 02:24:04','2025-10-17 09:48:34');
INSERT INTO offers VALUES(14,'{"en":"Elderly Health Check Package","id":"Paket Pemeriksaan Kesehatan Lansia"}','{"en":"elderly-health-check-package","id":"paket-pemeriksaan-kesehatan-lansia"}','18','{"en":"<h2 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Comprehensive Health Screening for Seniors</h2><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">As we age, the risk of chronic illnesses increases. Regular health checks are essential to maintain quality of life and detect conditions early. Altius Hospitals offers a dedicated package for elderly patients.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Our medical team provides gentle care and thorough assessments to ensure seniors enjoy their golden years in good health.</p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Package Includes:</h3><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li><p>General practitioner consultation</p></li><li><p>Comprehensive blood tests (cholesterol, glucose, kidney &amp; liver function)</p></li><li><p>Electrocardiogram (ECG) to monitor heart health</p></li><li><p>Bone density test for osteoporosis screening</p></li></ul><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Special promotional rate starts from <strong>IDR 1,500,000</strong>. Give your loved ones the gift of long-lasting health and vitality.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong>Healthy Aging with Altius Hospitals – because growing old should mean growing strong.</strong></p>","id":"<h2 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Pemeriksaan Kesehatan Komprehensif untuk Lansia</h2><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Seiring bertambahnya usia, risiko penyakit kronis meningkat. Pemeriksaan kesehatan secara rutin sangat penting untuk menjaga kualitas hidup dan mendeteksi kondisi lebih awal. Rumah Sakit Altius menawarkan paket khusus untuk pasien lansia.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Tim medis kami memberikan perawatan yang lembut dan penilaian menyeluruh untuk memastikan para lansia menikmati masa tua mereka dalam kesehatan yang baik.</p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Paket Termasuk:</h3><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li><p>Konsultasi dokter umum</p></li><li><p>Tes darah komprehensif (kolesterol, glukosa, fungsi ginjal &amp; hati)</p></li><li><p>Elektrokardiogram (EKG) untuk memantau kesehatan jantung</p></li><li><p>Tes kepadatan tulang untuk skrining osteoporosis</p></li></ul><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Tarif promosi khusus mulai dari <strong>IDR 1,500,000</strong>. Berikan kepada orang yang Anda cintai hadiah berupa kesehatan dan vitalitas yang tahan lama.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong>Penuaan Sehat dengan Rumah Sakit Altius – karena menua seharusnya berarti menjadi lebih kuat.</strong></p>"}',3,'2025-10-17 02:25:54','2025-10-17 09:48:22');
